menu "PrivacySense Matter Room Hub"
    config UI_RGB_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "RGB diagnostic color cycle"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the RGB LED cycles through 6 colours + off (2 s each)
            instead of showing the room state. Used for hardware verification of
            the on-board WS2812 LED. The OLED and heartbeat logging still run in
            this mode.

    config NETWORK_DIAG_CONSOLE
        bool "Network diagnostic console commands"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, registers wifi_cred, wifi_status and wifi_fault console
            commands for Wi-Fi testing, and enables fault injection paths in the
            network stack. Disable in production builds.
endmenu
